name egpeirce
category Package
revision 66924
shortdesc Draw existential graphs invented by Charles S. Peirce
relocated 1
longdesc This package is for drawing existential graphs invented and
longdesc developed by philosopher and polymath Charles S. Peirce. It
longdesc also contains new and unique symbols for several types of
longdesc linear logical operators Peirce invented and used in his larger
longdesc logical system.
runfiles size=25
